<title>AUSTRALIA: Network Solutions ends first day 9 cents up.</title>
<headline>Network Solutions ends first day 9 cents up.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in computer data security company Secure Network Solutions Ltd ended the first day's trading on the Australian Stock Exchange at 34 cents each, nine cents above the offer price.</p>
<p>About 1.35 million shares were traded on the first day. The Melbourne-based company has a market capitalisation of A$16.49 million based on 48.5 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The company offered 10 million shares in its float prospectus at 25 cents each.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
